    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractive 3 bedroom end townhouse situated in this most convenient and sought after location.\r\n\r\nGreenhills Court is a most desirable location being within walking distance to excellent quality schools and convenient commute to Douglas Village and Cork City Centre about 25 minute walk , there is also an excellent bus service available.\r\n\r\nNumber 94 benefits from an excellent design and layout due to the fact there is an extension to provide kitchen which gives the opportunity to use a second reception room as a 4th bedroom. As it is an end house there is a side entrance to provide access to rear garden. \r\n\r\nThis property is an ideal opportunity to first time buyers looking to purchase in Cork City and also may appeal to investors as it is an owner occupied residence and there no rent cap in place."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Reception foyer; nice bright entrance with timber style floor and window\r\nleads to the hallway 4.30m x 4.19m. Carpet Floor and stairs.\r\n\r\nLiving Room; 4.83m x 4.19m\r\nGood size living room.  Carpet Floor\r\n\r\nLounge; 4.83m x 2.62m\r\ncurrently used as a bedroom.\r\nFloor is carpet.\r\n\r\nKitchen; 3.83m X 2.43m\r\nGood selection of wall and floor units\r\ntimber style floor.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor;\r\nBedroom 1; 4.52m X 2.5m\r\nBedroom 2; 4.51m X 2.50m\r\nBedroom 3; 3.44m X 1.86m\r\nBathroom;\r\nThree piece suite.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: -  Note the above particulars are confidential, and are given on the strict understanding that all negotiations shall be conducted through this firm.  Every care has  been taken in their preparation, but we do not hold ourselves responsible for any inaccuracies.  All reasonable offers will be submitted to the owner"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "End of terrace house with side entrance to rear.\r\nWalking distance to Douglas village and Cork City Centre\r\nOn 206 Bus Route\r\nEasy access to South Ring Road"
      },
